## Permission Data Loading

### 1. Optimized Permission Data Queries
```java
@Repository
public class TimesheetRepository {
    
    // Load timesheet data with related candidates and jobs for permission checking
    public List<TimesheetPermissionDataDto> findTimesheetPermissionData(List<Integer> timesheetIds, 
                                                                       Integer accountId) {
        return jooqDslContextTarget.getDslContext()
            .select(
                Tables.TIMESHEET.ID.as("timesheetId"),
                Tables.TIMESHEET.CANDIDATE_ID.as("candidateId"),
                Tables.TIMESHEET.JOB_ID.as("jobId"),
                Tables.CANDIDATE.ID.as("candidateEntityId"),
                Tables.CANDIDATE.NAME.as("candidateName"),
                Tables.JOB.ID.as("jobEntityId"),
                Tables.JOB.TITLE.as("jobTitle")
            )
            .from(Tables.TIMESHEET)
            .leftJoin(Tables.CANDIDATE).on(Tables.TIMESHEET.CANDIDATE_ID.eq(Tables.CANDIDATE.ID))
            .leftJoin(Tables.JOB).on(Tables.TIMESHEET.JOB_ID.eq(Tables.JOB.ID))
            .where(Tables.TIMESHEET.ID.in(timesheetIds))
            .and(Tables.TIMESHEET.ACCOUNT_ID.eq(accountId))
            .fetchInto(TimesheetPermissionDataDto.class);
    }
}
```

